<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 17.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 17.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Mar 17	Mar 14     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  266.270     268.390     247.020    7.79 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  305.900     305.530     306.830   -0.30 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.940     157.440     158.970   -0.65 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.808	46.660	47.182   -0.79 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  424.400     428.100     419.180    1.25 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.400     139.925     141.685   -0.91 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.765	15.795	16.185   -2.59 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.530     216.940     212.430    1.46 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.861	 1.855	 1.888   -1.43 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.571	 1.566	 1.581   -0.63 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  183.385     182.965     183.135    0.14%</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
